OL,3,A'The music transported us to another
OL,4,Aplanet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNor could they have imagined that,
OL,7,Fdecades later, they would be reunited
OL,8,Fthrough the photo and finally have
OL,9,Ftheir stories told.
